 "brief": "The Democratic Front for the Liberation of Palestine issued a sharp condemnation of an Israeli military operation that targeted Palestinian police personnel in Gaza, killing and wounding dozens of officers, Shehab Wire reported. The front said the strike underscores occupation forces' commitment to genocide and destabilizing the enclave.\n\nThe attack came within 24 hours of another incident in the territory. The Democratic Front's statement did not provide casualty figures or specify which police units were struck. The group's denunciation marked the latest Palestinian faction response to Israeli operations in Gaza as violence continues across the territory.",
